## 13. HOW TO RESUME IN ONE PARAGRAPH
===============================================================================

Read `ml/runs/encoder.log` and `ml/runs/pipeline.log`. If training finished, the
chained script has likely already produced tuned constants and test-set
accuracy — paste the printed constants into SwipeBeam.kt's companion object,
run the lexicon sweep (section 9 step 3), pick a lexicon, regenerate
swipe_words.txt, re-export the weights, set LOG_TIMING=false, rebuild, install,
re-select the IME on the device (section 11), and verify a real gesture commits
the right word. Then decide with the user whether to build the ContextLM.
